## Pseudocode

```
inventory llm_wiki_coupling across docs, registries, scripts, issue workflows, and navigation surfaces
capture current strengths and bottlenecks of embedded architecture
define three options: stay_embedded, standalone_repo, split_core_plus_content
for each option:
    score coupling, portability, CI boundaries, search/index ownership, contribution ergonomics, migration risk
identify which concerns are solved immediately and which are merely relocated
recommend one option with explicit non-goals and rollback conditions
if recommendation implies movement:
    outline migration phases, backlinks/sync model, versioning, and rollback path
```

